WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.386 --> 00:00:12.387
It's stuck!

00:00:19.436 --> 00:00:20.562
Throw me the rope!

00:00:21.187 --> 00:00:22.439
The rope?

00:00:26.026 --> 00:00:27.110
Hurry!

00:00:58.058 --> 00:00:59.142
Are you okay?

00:01:00.727 --> 00:01:03.521
Yeah. Oh, um...

00:01:05.356 --> 00:01:07.192
Are you a real person?

00:01:07.692 --> 00:01:09.486
Don't let anyone hear us.

00:01:10.528 --> 00:01:13.364
You look like the girl I saw in my dreams.

00:01:14.115 --> 00:01:15.200
Dreams?

00:01:29.798 --> 00:01:30.840
Thanks.

00:01:35.345 --> 00:01:36.679
It's not a dream.

